  "notes": "VERB TYPE:\n⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive verb)\nGodan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし})\n\nWRITING:\nCan be written as {煌|きら}めく (literary).\n\n- きらめかない (negative)\n- きらめいて (te-form)\n- きらめいた (past)\n\nONOMATOPOEIA:\nRelated to ⟦きらきら→きらきら：05159_kirakira⟧ (glittering, twinkling), which is the onomatopoeic adverb form.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{輝|かがや}く→輝く：02032_kagayaku⟧ - to shine, radiate (broader meaning)\n- ⟦{光|ひか}る→光る：01163_hikaru⟧ - to shine, glow\n- またたく - to twinkle (especially stars)\n- ⟦きらきら→きらきら：05159_kirakira⟧⟦{光|ひか}る→光る：01163_hikaru⟧ - to glitter",
